  "description": "Pi 扩展合集：PWR (Pi Workflow Runtime) + agent-team / stream-token-speed / chatanywhere-provider / provider-quota / run-timer / loop / goal / opencode-bridge / deep-init / human-notify / solo-mode；另有独立运行（非扩展）的 agent-manager 工具：会话浏览/检索/重命名/可恢复删除 + agent 子进程管理 + 零依赖浏览器前端",
